---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Setup Required" showNav={false}>
  <div class="setup-container">
    <div class="card setup-card">
      <div class="setup-header">
        <h1>Welcome to Job Tracker</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Initial Setup Required</p>
      </div>

      <div class="setup-body">
        <p>Before using the application, you need to configure your password and secrets in your environment:</p>

        <ol class="setup-steps">
          <li>
            <strong>Generate a password hash:</strong>
            <pre><code>npm run hash-password &lt;your-password&gt;</code></pre>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Create or update your <code>.env</code> file:</strong>
            <pre><code>DATABASE_URL=postgres://...
SESSION_SECRET=&lt;generate 32+ random characters&gt;
APP_PASSWORD_HASH=&lt;pasted hash from step 1&gt;</code></pre>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Apply database migrations:</strong>
            <pre><code>npm run db:migrate</code></pre>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Restart the server:</strong>
            <pre><code>npm run dev</code></pre>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="setup-footer">
          <p class="hint">Once <code>APP_PASSWORD_HASH</code> is configured, reload this page to log in.</p>
          <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Check Configuration &amp; Reload</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .setup-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 80vh;
  }
  .setup-card {
    max-width: 600px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .setup-header {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .setup-header h1 {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .setup-body p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .setup-steps {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .setup-steps li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  pre {
    background-color: var(--bg-subtle);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .setup-footer {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .hint {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
</style>
